## What Holds It Together

If each creator type uses a different set of products, what makes this one platform rather than eight separate tools?

Three things:

**Shared infrastructure.** All eight creator types ultimately run on the same 30+ models. The Filmmaker and the E-commerce brand and the Developer are all calling Seedance, Kling, Veo, Flux — the same underlying models, different workflows built on top. Bigsfield's model relationships and integrations benefit every user type simultaneously.

**Shared economics.** The Casual Creator populates the Community with content that inspires the Filmmaker. The Filmmaker's work sets the quality ceiling that makes the Marketer trust the platform. The Developer's integrations bring in users who become Social Media Creators. Each type creates value that other types consume — often without knowing it.

**One login, one account.** A creator who starts as a Social Media Creator and builds a brand doesn't need to switch platforms when they need Marketing Studio. They're already there. As users grow and their needs evolve, Bigsfield evolves with them within the same environment. No migration, no re-learning, no lost history.

